  Banana / Joyful Smile — X-ray system patient-handoff REFERENCE
  ==============================================================
  This file is the OWNED contract reference for THIS imaging system only.
  It is NOT shared with other installer-* packages and must NOT be overwritten
  by build-installer-packages.ps1 (which only syncs engine .ps1 files).

  Develop this system's handoff independently:
    - Change fields / formats here when the vendor contract changes
    - Keep other systems' reference/*.xml untouched
    - Runtime code lives in xray-local-launcher.ps1 (EnabledSystems isolates)
  Sample chart is fictional (smoke/self-test style). Do not use on real patients.
